{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/vhdlmemorystructures\/vhdlparsing\/vhdlfile\/init(decodername:numberofelements:elementsize:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing\/VHDLFile\/init(decoderName:numberOfElements:elementSize:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Create a generic decoder.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures","doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing","doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing\/VHDLFile"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"relatedModules":["VHDLParsing"],"name":"VHDLMemoryStructures"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(decoderName:numberOfElements:elementSize:)","extendedModule":"VHDLParsing","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"?(","kind":"text"},{"text":"decoderName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VariableName","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11VHDLParsing12VariableNameV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"numberOfElements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elementSize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:11VHDLParsing8VHDLFileV20VHDLMemoryStructuresE11decoderName16numberOfElements11elementSizeACSgAA08VariableF0V_S2itcfc"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"?(","kind":"text"},{"text":"decoderName","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VariableName","preciseIdentifier":"s:11VHDLParsing12VariableNameV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"numberOfElements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elements","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elementSize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"size","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The name of the decoder.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"name"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of elements in the decoder."}]}],"name":"elements"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size of each element in the decoder."}]}],"name":"size"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This initialiser creates a 32-bit decoder that assumes each element within the encoded 32-bit value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contains an enable bit at it’s suffix. For example, the element ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0110\""},{"text":" of length 4-bits would be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"immediately followed by a 1-bit enable bit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"'1'"},{"text":". The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"elementSize"},{"text":" parameter should ignore this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enable bit when calculating the size of each element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, consider a 32-bit encoded value with 2 elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each of size 4-bits. The encoded value may be: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"11011000110000000000000000000000\""},{"type":"text","text":". The first element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"1101"},{"type":"text","text":" with enable bit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"'1'"},{"type":"text","text":", and the second element is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0001\""},{"type":"text","text":" with enable bit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"'1'"},{"type":"text","text":". All other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries are padding. The decoder will contain a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" input and 4 outputs named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"out0"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"out0en"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"out1"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"out1en"},{"type":"text","text":" representing the decoded elements and their enable bits respectively. Please note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the element starting at the most-significant bit of the encoded value is considered element 0."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"warning","name":"Warning","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"numberOfElements","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"elementSize","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameters must be greater than 0 and fit within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a 32-bit encoded value."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://VHDLMemoryStructures/documentation/VHDLMemoryStructures/VHDLParsing/VHDLFile/init(decoderName:numberOfElements:elementSize:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a generic decoder."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing\/VHDLFile\/init(decoderName:numberOfElements:elementSize:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"?("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"decoderName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11VHDLParsing12VariableNameV","text":"VariableName"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"numberOfElements","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"elementSize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/vhdlmemorystructures\/vhdlparsing\/vhdlfile\/init(decodername:numberofelements:elementsize:)","type":"topic","title":"init(decoderName:numberOfElements:elementSize:)"},"doc://VHDLMemoryStructures/documentation/VHDLMemoryStructures/VHDLParsing/VHDLFile":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"VHDLFile"}],"url":"\/documentation\/vhdlmemorystructures\/vhdlparsing\/vhdlfile","title":"VHDLFile","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a generic decoder."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing\/VHDLFile","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11VHDLParsing8VHDLFileV","kind":"identifier","text":"VHDLFile"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://VHDLMemoryStructures/documentation/VHDLMemoryStructures/VHDLParsing":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[],"title":"VHDLParsing","identifier":"doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/VHDLParsing","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/vhdlmemorystructures\/vhdlparsing"},"doc://VHDLMemoryStructures/documentation/VHDLMemoryStructures":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/VHDLMemoryStructures\/documentation\/VHDLMemoryStructures","url":"\/documentation\/vhdlmemorystructures","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"VHDLMemoryStructures"}}}